cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Scale-Dependent Symbolisation and Collision-Free Clustering of Map Features"
abstract: >-
  A JavaScript library that decides, for every record of a web map and every zoom level, in which single form the
  record is drawn: a line or polygon with its outline from the zoom level at which it is large enough on the screen,
  and a point marker before that; point markers that would be too close are grouped in nested clusters, and no marker
  or cluster is left touching another.
